-- Help Center: the "Your first contest is free" section in the two create-a-contest articles was not replaced by 0213 (the heading and its paragraph are separated by a blank line there, 0213 looked for a single line break). Same new text as 0213. Only articles nobody edited in Admin are changed (updated_by = 'seed').
UPDATE help_articles SET body = replace(body, '## Your first contest is free' || char(10) || char(10) || 'Your organization''s first contest in every 12-month window is free. To run more contests in the same window, the Review screen shows the contest passes when you need one, and your contest is created as soon as you pay. See [Contest passes](/help/contest-passes).', '## Choosing a contest pass' || char(10) || char(10) || 'Running a contest needs a contest pass. The Review screen shows the passes when your organization needs one, and your contest is created as soon as you pay. Residents enter and vote for free. See [Contest passes](/help/contest-passes).'), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug IN ('create-a-contest-quick-start', 'create-a-contest-customize') AND updated_by = 'seed' AND body LIKE '%## Your first contest is free%';
